        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8', letterSpacing: 1.6 }}>
            SEMESTER A 2026/27 · CITY UNIVERSITY OF HONG KONG
        </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#D6DCE5', marginTop: 18 }} />

    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Georgia, serif', fontSize: 50, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1.16, marginTop: 30 }}>
        The market as a<br />measuring instrument
    </Text>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 22 }}>
        Auditing the calibration of Pinnacle closing odds with models that only see pre-match information.
    </Text>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 20 }}>
        We do not try to beat the market. We ask where it answers badly — and whether a
        reproducible transparent model can follow it there.
    </Text>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 40, marginTop: 28 }}>
        <Box style={{
            width: 560,
            height: 118,
            padding: '20px 24px',
            background: '#F7F9FC',
            border: '1px solid #D6DCE5',
            borderRadius: 6,
            justifyContent: 'space-between',
        }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 1.4 }}>RQ1</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 6 }}>
                Does the market calibrate itself?
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 4 }}>H1 · H4</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{
            width: 560,
            height: 118,
            padding: '20px 24px',
            background: '#F7F9FC',
            border: '1px solid #D6DCE5',
            borderRadius: 6,
            justifyContent: 'space-between',
        }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 1.4 }}>RQ2</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 6 }}>
                Can a transparent model reach it?
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 4 }}>C1 · C2 · H2 · H3</Text>
